---
import check from '../../public/research/payoff-integrity-check.json';
interface Props { detailed?: boolean; }
const { detailed = false } = Astro.props;
---
<figure class="validation-excerpt">
  <figcaption><strong>A corrupted result is rejected</strong><span>Offline fixture test · 25 October 2026</span></figcaption>
  <dl>
    <div><dt>Changed record</dt><dd>A stored group payoff was altered; the action records were left intact.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Observed result</dt><dd>The independent payoff check failed. Summary generation refused the run and created no summary files.</dd></div>
  </dl>
  {detailed ? <><p class="check-test-result"><code>{check.test_result}</code></p><p class="figure-note">The validator recalculated the outcome from the retained action records. This single test used scripted advisers and measured software behaviour.</p><a class="read-link" href="/research/payoff-integrity-check.json" download>Download the check record (JSON)</a></> : <><p class="figure-note">The validator recalculates the outcome from the action records. This checks software behaviour using scripted advisers.</p><a class="read-link" href="/work/human-ai-collaboration/#payoff-check">Inspect the check record</a></>}
</figure>
